CompareBytes|Paired evidence bytes|A read-only preview of stored bytes for the selected finding. Each side begins at its own displayed file offset; missing evidence is shown explicitly.|Pink means unequal preview bytes. Amber marks the selected evidence range when the displayed bytes match. Use arrows for further pages, or A/B in editor to inspect a side in the main hex view.|Raw findings compare the same file positions. They do not align inserted blocks, so a small insertion may cause many downstream differences. Neither preview permits editing.
