Apply|Apply edit|Commits the dialog's proposed replacement to the current in-memory document.|Check the field name, offset and proposed value first, then apply and inspect Changes or the updated view to understand the result.|Apply changes document bytes, not the original disk file. Input and parse checks cannot establish that all runtime assumptions remain valid.
